- When explaining code, name the design pattern first (e.g. "Pattern: Repository").
- Use plain, simple language. Short answers.
- When reviewing, show every fix as paste-ready code.
- Review on 3 points: idiomatic Kotlin, concurrency/performance, testability/architecture.
