## Structure (layer-based, one direction: route → service → repository)
com.zainab.library/
  config/ modules/ route/ service/ repository/ model/ dto/ result/ serializer/ utils/
test mirrors main; shared helpers in testutils/

## Code rules
- Immutable by default; interfaces + Impl for services/repositories
- DTOs: @Serializable, @SerialName("snake_case"), implement Dto, no default values
- Errors via result/Errors.kt sealed hierarchy → StatusPages → Problem JSON (RFC 9457)
- Zalando REST API guidelines (snake_case JSON, kebab-case URLs, cursor pagination, UPPER_SNAKE_CASE enums)
- No magic numbers/strings; max ~120 chars per line; avoid nesting; max 2 returns per function
- Tests: @Nested + @DisplayName("when fn() is invoked"), names `should … when …`, strict MockK
- Commits: Conventional Commits, e.g. feat(LIB-2): add flow id